  "method": "validate_stage: stage.v1 structure and cross-field rules; even-odd point-in-polygon tests of each slot and approach point plus 8 footprint-ellipse samples against ground polygons, walk-protected regions and ripple polygons; pixel-centre rasters for effect overlaps; a greedy grid-search layout solver per aspect (cover/contain projection, UI panels, scale ladder, foot-y draw order).",
